%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm her guardian.\d%K%P
「我就是美都子的监护人」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's why I went to the school meeting. Not that it\nended up going well.\d%K%P
「所以我才去参加监护人座谈会。\n…虽说到头来不了了之了吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWait a second, Osamu...\d%K%P
「理你先等一下，那是…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Do you think that's going a bit too far?\d%K%P
「…果然，是不行的么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWait, before discussing how insane or ridiculous or\nthoughtless that is... Are you for real?\d%K%P
「在我说不行胡闹瞎搞乱来不动脑子之前，\n你啊，你是认真的？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm not trying to joke around.\d%K%P
「………至少，我没打算开玩笑」%K%P
Was she really planning to hurl all those adjectives my\nway if I said I was serious, though...?%K%P
『如果我说，我是认真的话，感觉就要被骂了…』%K%P
I decided to swallow my remaining comments for now, and\nreturned her gaze with resolute eyes.%K%P
我把这句话咽回肚子里，\n然后对上了麻实强气的双眼。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dFrom my perspective, it didn't look like Ms. Hinosaka\nappreciated your plan at all.\d%K%P
「但是，阳坂同学她好像\n完全不接受你的行动啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can't exactly deny the possibility that she thought I\nwas rather pathetic, and untrustworthy, and a failure as a\npotential guardian. But what actually happened there was\nactually not entirely undifferent from...\d%K%P
「那个大概跟我之前的不可靠啊没出息啊不讲究啊吊儿郎当啊\n看上去完全当不了监护人啊什么的关系密切吧，\n而且我也没有去反驳否定的自信与可能……」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUndifferent'? That isn't even a real word, you know.\d%K%P
「要说没可能也没可能…你这地球语言的使用方式错了哦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Is that so? I feel like I've seen a similar line in a\ngame before.\d%K%P
「诶…是嘛。\n我记得之前在游戏上还是什么上见到过这么说的来得」\n※译注：出自《青空下的约定》奈绪子Event。%K%P
Good thing that was all that grabbed her attention. With\nsome luck, she'd let the other comments slide for now.%K%P
她最先注意到的竟然是这一点，\n这反而让我更好说话了，真是求之不得。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBut why?\d%K%P
「为什么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, I had a lot of time on my hands last year... I was\nunemployed and all.\d%K%P
「啊不，去年一年都很闲啊因为…失业了毕竟」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI wasn't talking about that... W-Wait, did you say\nunemployed?! Oh, I'll want to hear all about that too, but\nfirst...\d%K%P
「不是说的那个…等，诶诶诶，失业！？\n啊～，我一会再仔细问吧，现在先不说那事了」%K%P
Our topic of conversation wouldn't stop shifting. Chalk\nthat up to my new lifestyle, I guess. Never a dull moment.%K%P
…感觉仓促中这话题跳跃有点大啊。\n嘛，也怪我，最近的生活变数太多了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI really should've asked this first, but... how exactly\nare you related to Ms. Hinosaka?\d%K%P
「本来应该一开始就问你的…\n你和阳坂同学到底是…什么关系啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...So you -were- curious about that, I see.\d%K%P
「…果然，会在意这个啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dConsidering my status as your former spouse, and as Ms.\nHinosaka's homeroom teacher, I am interested to hear.\nPlus, I can't exactly ignore a situation like this either\nway.\d%K%P
「作为原亲属我就很在意，\n作为阳坂同学的班主任我也不能坐视不管，\n就算作为一个普通人我也很感兴趣呐」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...It's kind of embarrassing to have you put me in the\nhot seat like that.\d%K%P
「…这还真是关注度太高让人很不好意思啊」%K%P
